{
  "body_human_readable": "## Weather in Kyiv: Cloudy with temperatures around 9\u00b0C\n\nAs of Wednesday afternoon in Kyiv, the weather is cloudy with a current temperature of 9\u00b0C (48\u00b0F), though it feels more like 6\u00b0C (43\u00b0F). There is a 15% chance of rain.\n\nThe humidity is currently around 59%. The wind is blowing from the east at a speed of 14 km/h, with gusts up to 21 km/h. Visibility is reported to be 52 kilometers.\n\nThe forecast for the rest of the day indicates a high of 9\u00b0C (49\u00b0F) and a low of 4\u00b0C (39\u00b0F). Light rain is expected during the day and night, with a 25% chance of rain during the day and a 35% chance at night. The sun rose at 6:58 AM and is expected to set at 6:37 PM.",
